asr-000145
00:06:51.160 --> 00:06:53.240
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: At the DTI, our main mandate

asr-000146
00:06:53.240 --> 00:06:55.319
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: is straightforward but important

asr-000147
00:06:55.319 --> 00:06:58.080
