asr-000148
00:06:58.080 --> 00:06:59.000
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: sa ekonomiya

asr-000149
00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:00.000
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and sa lives

asr-000150
00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:01.960
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: ng ating mga kababayan.

asr-000151
00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:04.579
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: DTI has three main mandates.

asr-000152
00:07:04.639 --> 00:07:07.199
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Firstly, foreign trade

asr-000153
00:07:07.199 --> 00:07:08.940
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and international investments.

asr-000154
00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:11.560
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Secondly, consumer protection

asr-000155
00:07:11.560 --> 00:07:12.879
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and fair trade.

asr-000156
00:07:12.879 --> 00:07:14.960
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: And third, MSME development.

asr-000157
00:07:14.960 --> 00:07:16.759
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: This is a sector that we definitely

asr-000158
00:07:16.759 --> 00:07:17.560
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: cannot ignore.

asr-000159
00:07:18.720 --> 00:07:20.520
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Today we present our budget

asr-000160
00:07:20.520 --> 00:07:22.800
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: from a position of economic strength

asr-000161
00:07:22.800 --> 00:07:24.440
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and historic growth.

asr-000162
00:07:24.440 --> 00:07:27.340
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Allow me to highlight our major achievements.

asr-000163
00:07:28.720 --> 00:07:28.880
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: For

asr-000164
00:07:29.759 --> 00:07:31.540
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: foreign trade and investment,

asr-000165
00:07:31.840 --> 00:07:33.199
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: the Philippines continues

asr-000166
00:07:33.199 --> 00:07:34.360
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: to position itself

asr-000167
00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:37.280
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: as a destination of choice

asr-000168
00:07:37.280 --> 00:07:39.240
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: for investments and a reliable

asr-000169
00:07:39.240 --> 00:07:40.159
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: trading partner.

asr-000170
00:07:40.639 --> 00:07:42.800
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: But we can do so much better.

asr-000171
00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:44.360
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We are currently experiencing

asr-000172
00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:46.500
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: an era of economic expansion.

asr-000173
00:07:46.919 --> 00:07:48.260
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: In 2025,

asr-000174
00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:50.159
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Philippine exports surged

asr-000175
00:07:50.159 --> 00:07:51.980
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: by 15.4%,

asr-000176
00:07:52.599 --> 00:07:55.220
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: which is an all-time

asr-000177
00:07:57.199 --> 00:07:57.879
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: high.

asr-000178
00:07:57.879 --> 00:07:59.440
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We carry this momentum

asr-000179
00:07:59.440 --> 00:08:01.120
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: straight in 2026

asr-000180
00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:02.560
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: with the monthly export

asr-000181
00:08:02.560 --> 00:08:03.939
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: growing consistently.

asr-000182
00:08:04.520 --> 00:08:06.940
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: 8.7% in January,

asr-000183
00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:09.239
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: 8.9% in February,

asr-000184
00:08:09.680 --> 00:08:10.500
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: 20.4%

asr-000185
00:08:11.319 --> 00:08:12.300
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: up in March,

asr-000186
00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:15.479
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: 7.2% up in April,

asr-000187
00:08:15.479 --> 00:08:17.159
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: 7.6% up

asr-000188
00:08:17.159 --> 00:08:18.120
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: in May, and

asr-000189
00:08:18.120 --> 00:08:20.780
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: 24.1% up in June.

asr-000190
00:08:21.639 --> 00:08:22.560
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: What does this mean?

asr-000191
00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:24.400
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: That the Filipino products are ready

asr-000192
00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:25.599
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: for the global market

asr-000193
00:08:25.599 --> 00:08:29.060
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and tinatangkilik na po ang ating mga produkto all over the world.

asr-000194
00:08:29.680 --> 00:08:30.879
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We are very strong

