00:14:40.800 --> 00:14:42.480
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: But now with the free trade agreement,

asr-000381
00:14:42.480 --> 00:14:44.199
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: that will really lower down

asr-000382
00:14:44.199 --> 00:14:46.240
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: if not totally eliminate the tariff.

asr-000383
00:14:46.240 --> 00:14:49.240
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So importante po ito para sa ating mga, um,

asr-000384
00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:51.160
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: businessmen, businesses,

asr-000385
00:14:51.160 --> 00:14:53.020
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and also for the communities.

asr-000386
00:14:53.759 --> 00:14:54.639
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Meanwhile, the

asr-000387
00:14:54.639 --> 00:14:56.639
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Philippine Economic Zone Authority,

asr-000388
00:14:56.639 --> 00:14:59.540
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: or PEZA, continues to attract investors

asr-000402
00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:08.120
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: because of their good reputation that they make sure that inaalagaan nila lahat ng mga investors

asr-000403
00:15:08.120 --> 00:15:10.720
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: or lahat ng mga may investments dito sa Pilipinas.

asr-000404
00:15:11.440 --> 00:15:18.960
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: They have approved 260.89 billion in investments in 2025.

asr-000405
00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:22.759
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: In the first eight months, in 2026 alone,

asr-000406
00:15:22.759 --> 00:15:32.240
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: PEZA has already approved 216.46 billion in investments across 196 new and expansion projects,

asr-000407
00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:35.960
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: securing 72.16 percent of its annual target.

asr-000408
00:15:36.639 --> 00:15:41.939
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: These projects are projected to generate 27,000 direct jobs nationwide.

asr-000409
00:15:42.720 --> 00:15:50.640
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Through the Create More Act and the 2026 SIPP and the Green Lanes for Strategic Investments,

asr-000410
00:15:51.240 --> 00:15:52.040
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: we are...

asr-000411
00:15:52.519 --> 00:15:56.240
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: fast and we continue to attract new investors,

asr-000412
00:15:56.759 --> 00:16:01.120
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: encourage expansion of existing investments in the Philippines,

asr-000413
00:16:01.120 --> 00:16:03.519
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and we provide more opportunities for them.

asr-000414
00:16:04.199 --> 00:16:06.000
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We make sure that we get things done,

asr-000415
00:16:06.000 --> 00:16:14.120
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and we keep an open line with all the companies that have investments in the country.

asr-000416
00:16:14.120 --> 00:16:21.399
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We really encourage expansion, lalo na sa mga may mga investments na dito.

asr-000417
00:16:21.399 --> 00:16:22.240
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So, aggressive po.

asr-000418
00:16:22.240 --> 00:16:23.959
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Ang approach namin dito.

asr-000419
00:16:23.959 --> 00:16:28.399
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So, we continue to create more eco-zones to suit the needs of investors

asr-000420
00:16:28.399 --> 00:16:30.720
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: that want to invest here in the Philippines.

asr-000421
00:16:30.720 --> 00:16:32.519
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Para may choices po sila.

asr-000422
00:16:32.519 --> 00:16:34.800
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So, every time an investor comes into the Philippines,

asr-000423
00:16:35.399 --> 00:16:39.040
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: we present all eco-zones that are available in the country,

asr-000424
00:16:39.560 --> 00:16:42.759
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: not just PEZA and BOI, which are under DTI.

asr-000425
00:16:42.759 --> 00:16:50.440
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Lahat po ng eco-zones, we give it to them para makapili sila kung ano yung best para sa negosyo nila

asr-000426
00:16:50.440 --> 00:16:51.120
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: or para sa...

asr-000427
00:16:52.399 --> 00:16:54.920
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: industries na gusto nilang pasukan.

asr-000428
00:16:56.040 --> 00:16:59.799
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Second is the local industry and MSME development.

asr-000429
00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:02.920
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: This is a sector that we definitely cannot ignore.

asr-000430
00:17:03.680 --> 00:17:10.480
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Guided by our first industrialization policy, Tatak Pinoy—proudly Filipino, built for the world—

asr-000431
00:17:10.480 --> 00:17:15.300
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: our vision is to elevate local industries across nine key sectors,

asr-000432
00:17:15.720 --> 00:17:20.679
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: creating world-class products designed to be sold locally and globally.

asr-000433
00:17:21.280 --> 00:17:22.220
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Of course,

asr-000437
00:17:22.240 --> 00:17:27.919
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Importante ang global market, pero we also need to exhaust the strength of our local market.

asr-000438
00:17:27.919 --> 00:17:35.000
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Kasi actually yung local market of almost 115 million Filipinos is what attracts foreign investments to our country

asr-000439
00:17:35.000 --> 00:17:36.840
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: or foreign investors to our country.

asr-000440
00:17:36.840 --> 00:17:43.599
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So we encourage them to export, but we also encourage them to sell locally.

asr-000441
00:17:44.840 --> 00:17:48.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Importante din for us to provide market access for them.

asr-000442
00:17:49.120 --> 00:17:51.240
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We have a lot of trade shows.

asr-000443
00:17:51.240 --> 00:17:53.060
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Our trade shows have been...

asr-000444
00:17:53.080 --> 00:18:01.779
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So from those trade shows, we invite now buyers, let's say, hotel buyers, cafe buyers, grocery, supermarkets,

asr-000445
00:18:02.440 --> 00:18:09.400
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: institutional buyers, consolidators, and foreign buyers, actually, to all of these trade shows.

asr-000446
00:18:09.400 --> 00:18:15.119
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: And our trade show sales has grown leaps and bounds, including those that attend the trade shows.

asr-000447
00:18:15.799 --> 00:18:19.540
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Another thing that we encourage is the double income in a family.

asr-000448
00:18:20.080 --> 00:18:21.880
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So the DTI has also...

asr-000449
00:18:21.880 --> 00:18:24.760
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: The DTI has also established the Women's Enterprise Fund.

asr-000450
00:18:24.760 --> 00:18:33.679
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Kasi in the Asian style, it's always the men that works and the women stays at home and takes care of the children.

asr-000451
00:18:33.679 --> 00:18:38.200
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So ang pinush namin ngayon is to encourage double income in a family.

asr-000452
00:18:38.200 --> 00:18:42.679
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So we've set aside 2 billion pesos for Women's Enterprise Fund.

asr-000453
00:18:42.679 --> 00:18:44.760
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So they can do business sa bahay.

asr-000454
00:18:44.760 --> 00:18:49.039
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Or if they have existing businesses that they want to expand, they want to grow,

asr-000455
00:18:49.039 --> 00:18:50.640
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: meron kaming fund for them.

asr-000456
00:18:50.640 --> 00:18:51.600
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Later, I will explain.

asr-000457
00:18:51.600 --> 00:18:59.820
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: The funding that we have given to, not just the women's, but to other sectors.

asr-000458
00:19:00.280 --> 00:19:06.340
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Okay, when double income, napaka-importante ang double income in a family because we encourage...

asr-000459
00:19:07.240 --> 00:19:11.880
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Because of this double income, there's better education, better quality of life.

asr-000460
00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:14.240
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Pwede na silang lumabas pag-weekend.

asr-000461
00:19:14.240 --> 00:19:20.880
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: They can eat out or they can also mag-vacate.

asr-000462
00:19:22.640 --> 00:19:29.480
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Importante rin for them to eat out because tataas din yung mga sales ng indirect investments,

asr-000463
00:19:29.480 --> 00:19:31.240
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: which will also provide the jobs.

asr-000464
00:19:31.799 --> 00:19:35.159
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: And this will also strengthen the local tourism.

asr-000465
00:19:35.159 --> 00:19:37.579
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So we need to encourage double income in the family.

asr-000466
00:19:38.600 --> 00:19:45.280
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So importante din ito because we really want to push na dito sila.

asr-000467
00:19:45.280 --> 00:19:46.559
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: They stay in the Philippines.

asr-000468
00:19:46.559 --> 00:19:49.240
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We want a better life for our Filipino people.

asr-000469
00:19:49.240 --> 00:19:51.679
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So we need to strengthen the small and medium.

asr-000470
00:19:51.679 --> 00:19:57.000
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We need to strengthen the enterprises and we need to strengthen also yung market access for them.

asr-000471
00:19:57.000 --> 00:20:03.860
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: In 2025, our nationwide efforts to expand market access, in spite of our budget,

asr-000472
00:20:05.400 --> 00:20:10.419
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: we needed to achieve exceptional results and we needed to be strategic in our moves.

asr-000473
00:20:10.919 --> 00:20:14.820
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Hindi siya pwedeng, we just move without strategizing.

asr-000474
00:20:15.080 --> 00:20:21.600
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So we expanded our reach by organizing a total of 33 trade fairs across NDA.

asr-000475
00:20:21.600 --> 00:20:23.559
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: NCR and other regions.

asr-000476
00:20:23.559 --> 00:20:26.980
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: But we can grow more if we increase our budget.

asr-000477
00:20:27.559 --> 00:20:33.919
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: The more market access or the more avenues we have for them to showcase their products,

asr-000478
00:20:33.919 --> 00:20:37.760
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: the better it is for them because then makaka-employ sila ng tao

asr-000479
00:20:37.760 --> 00:20:44.420
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and they can also level up the jobs and also help the community.

asr-000480
00:20:44.960 --> 00:20:51.000
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We generated a combined sales of our trade show nasa 1.0.

asr-000481
00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:53.640
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: 9 billion pesos already.

asr-000482
00:20:53.640 --> 00:21:00.880
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: But we are providing wider market access to more than 3,500 MSME's across the country.

asr-000483
00:21:00.880 --> 00:21:09.480
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: And for 2026, we will be conducting a total of 38 trade fairs locally, which provide more market access.

asr-000484
00:21:09.480 --> 00:21:11.600
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: And these trade fairs are free.

asr-000485
00:21:11.600 --> 00:21:18.679
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So lahat ng mga MSME's or SME's that want to join the DTI's trade fair nationwide, libre po ito.

asr-000486
00:21:18.679 --> 00:21:19.840
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So this is for them.

asr-000487
00:21:19.840 --> 00:21:21.859
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: They just have to be government-compliant.

asr-000488
00:21:22.520 --> 00:21:28.639
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Without the market access or place for them to showcase their products, then all these products don't mean anything.

asr-000489
00:21:29.320 --> 00:21:41.880
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: The DTI works closely also with institutions such as SM, Robinsons, and other big corporations to actually showcase their products.

asr-000490
00:21:41.880 --> 00:21:53.260
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So naging maganda po ang relationship natin sa mga institution na ito because they're the ones who can really provide for these SMEs.

asr-000491
00:21:54.279 --> 00:22:03.959
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We need to convert their products to sales that will provide more jobs and uplift indirect industries and provide a better life for our people.

asr-000492
00:22:04.400 --> 00:22:07.400
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: But we need to be strategic again in our moves.

asr-000493
00:22:08.400 --> 00:22:11.200
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Beyond providing market access through the trade fairs,

asr-000494
00:22:11.200 --> 00:22:12.840
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: we are addressing the financial

asr-000496
00:22:12.840 --> 00:22:15.559
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: barriers of our local businesses and MSMEs.

asr-000497
00:22:15.559 --> 00:22:19.780
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Ang pinakaimportante sa kanila ay finance, financial assistance.

asr-000498
00:22:20.080 --> 00:22:24.500
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So, we have a lot of loans in DTI SB Corporation.

asr-000499
00:22:25.000 --> 00:22:29.440
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: The loans program has already changed since last year.

asr-000500
00:22:29.440 --> 00:22:37.480
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So, up to 5 million, no collateral, and one year, no payment of principal and interest para makausad sila.

asr-000501
00:22:37.480 --> 00:22:41.339
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: They need that one year for them to move their...

asr-000502
00:22:41.799 --> 00:22:43.000
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: I mean, move the business.

asr-000503
00:22:43.000 --> 00:22:48.559
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Kasi hindi puwede na when they loan, the first month pa lang, nagbabayad na sila ng utang.

asr-000504
00:22:48.559 --> 00:22:53.620
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So we gave one year, basta up to 5 million, no payment of principal and interest.

asr-000505
00:22:54.240 --> 00:22:55.039
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: During the...

asr-000506
00:22:55.039 --> 00:23:00.220
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We have 12 billion for this, but actually, we need more funds, especially during...

asr-000507
00:23:00.679 --> 00:23:02.580
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: kasi nagka-Middle East crisis.

asr-000508
00:23:02.720 --> 00:23:11.520
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So, during the Middle East crisis, we have established funds that were targeted to address the needs of...

asr-000509
00:23:11.520 --> 00:23:13.980
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: of the MSMEs during this crisis.

asr-000510
00:23:14.840 --> 00:23:18.679
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: One is the Women's Enterprise Fund, which I mentioned a while ago,

asr-000511
00:23:18.679 --> 00:23:21.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: where we encourage the double income in a family.

asr-000512
00:23:21.600 --> 00:23:28.799
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Next is the Export Business Expansion Fund, which we have seen growth in our exports.

asr-000513
00:23:28.799 --> 00:23:31.619
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So kung minsan, malaking order nila, wala silang fund,

asr-000514
00:23:32.279 --> 00:23:37.400
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: or kulang ang pera nila pangbili ng raw materials or pag-upgrade ng machine.

asr-000515
00:23:37.400 --> 00:23:38.799
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So, we have a fund for them.

asr-000516
00:23:39.600 --> 00:23:41.159
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: MSME Business Fund.

asr-000517
00:23:41.159 --> 00:23:44.620
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So natamaan ang mga MSMEs during this Middle East crisis.

asr-000518
00:23:45.159 --> 00:23:53.000
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Then, we have the OFW Negotiation Fund, because a lot of the OFWs came home during this Middle East crisis.

asr-000519
00:23:53.000 --> 00:23:54.400
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So naghahanap sila ng...

asr-000520
00:23:54.400 --> 00:23:57.219
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: or may mga negosyo na sila na gusto nilang i-expand.

asr-000521
00:23:57.679 --> 00:24:00.840
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: And then, we also have the E-Transport Loan Program,

asr-000522
00:24:01.200 --> 00:24:07.240
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: because we encourage the transport operators, the small and medium transport operators,

asr-000523
00:24:07.240 --> 00:24:10.279
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: or individual operators, actually, who want to shift.

asr-000524
00:24:11.159 --> 00:24:14.279
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: From the combustion vehicles to electric vehicles.

asr-000525
00:24:14.279 --> 00:24:20.040
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Kasi [unclear], nagtaas 'yung presyo ng petroleum, or ng crudo, ng oil, ng diesel.

asr-000526
00:24:20.440 --> 00:24:22.480
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So, we have funding for them.

asr-000527
00:24:22.480 --> 00:24:26.559
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Again, up to 5 million, no collateral.

asr-000528
00:24:26.559 --> 00:24:31.880
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: And again, one year, no payment of principal and interest.

asr-000529
00:24:31.880 --> 00:24:34.760
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: There are so many that have availed of this loan.

asr-000530
00:24:34.760 --> 00:24:39.360
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So, we are hoping that we can get more funds for this.

asr-000531
00:24:39.360 --> 00:24:41.440
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: kasi maraming nag-avail talaga

asr-000532
00:24:41.440 --> 00:24:45.000
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: ng ano, ng mga loan—loan programs na ito.

asr-000533
00:24:45.000 --> 00:24:47.620
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Because of the easy payment scheme.

asr-000534
00:24:48.320 --> 00:24:53.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: And also, we only require, number one, business name registration.

asr-000535
00:24:53.200 --> 00:24:56.100
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Number two, government permits.

asr-000536
00:24:56.600 --> 00:24:58.240
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Number three, bank account.

asr-000537
00:24:58.240 --> 00:25:00.039
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: And number four, picture of their business.

asr-000538
00:25:00.039 --> 00:25:02.200
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: In other words, we make it easy for them to loan.

asr-000539
00:25:02.200 --> 00:25:07.600
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: kasi alam natin kung gaano nila kailangan itong, um, financial assistance.

asr-000540
00:25:08.159 --> 00:25:10.159
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We want to teach them how to fish.

asr-000541
00:25:10.159 --> 00:25:11.039
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: And not just...

asr-000542
00:25:11.640 --> 00:25:13.120
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: And then, in every calamity...

asr-000543
00:25:13.120 --> 00:25:15.720
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We also have the Enterprise Rehabilitation Fund.

asr-000544
00:25:15.720 --> 00:25:19.620
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Because in every calamity, or let's say there's a typhoon or what,

asr-000545
00:25:20.279 --> 00:25:22.039
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: 'yung mga businesses natatamaan.

asr-000546
00:25:22.360 --> 00:25:26.720
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So, we need to give them funding so that they can not just physically recover,

asr-000547
00:25:26.720 --> 00:25:28.560
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: but the businesses can also recover.

asr-000548
00:25:28.960 --> 00:25:31.440
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So, we also have funding for this.

asr-000549
00:25:31.440 --> 00:25:33.159
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: And building on this momentum,

asr-000550
00:25:33.159 --> 00:25:37.000
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: we just recently introduced the Youth Enterprise Fund.

asr-000551
00:25:37.840 --> 00:25:40.679
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We set aside 1 billion pesos to encourage the...

asr-000552
00:25:40.679 --> 00:25:44.560
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: the youth to get or to explore business.

asr-000553
00:25:45.000 --> 00:25:49.799
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Kasi ngayon, 'yung mga youth are now in the social media all the time.

asr-000554
00:25:49.799 --> 00:25:52.279
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So, their strength in the digital space,

asr-000555
00:25:52.279 --> 00:25:56.240
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: they can use it, ah, para maging negosyante sila.

asr-000556
00:25:56.240 --> 00:25:59.559
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So kung minsan may mga produkto sila or they have an idea.

asr-000557
00:25:59.559 --> 00:26:02.039
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: At least meron tayong fund para sa kanila.

asr-000558
00:26:02.039 --> 00:26:05.000
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So, again, they can loan from the DTI SB Corporation.

asr-000559
00:26:05.000 --> 00:26:10.940
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Again, up to 30,000 to 500,000, no collateral.

asr-000560
00:26:11.200 --> 00:26:14.399
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: And then, one year, again, no payment of principal and interest.

asr-000561
00:26:14.399 --> 00:26:17.040
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So, we encourage the youth to explore

asr-000562
00:26:17.600 --> 00:26:23.079
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and for them to at least know that the government has funding for them.

asr-000563
00:26:23.640 --> 00:26:28.539
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Despite these milestones, the demand from our entrepreneurs remains overwhelming.

asr-000564
00:26:28.919 --> 00:26:35.240
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Currently, we have received, actually, so much applicants now

asr-000565
00:26:35.240 --> 00:26:38.760
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: that we need additional finance for this.

asr-000566
00:26:41.520 --> 00:26:42.200
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Um...

asr-000567
00:26:42.200 --> 00:26:43.720
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We figure out...

asr-000568
00:26:43.720 --> 00:26:46.760
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: No, we know that napakaimportante this funding because

asr-000569
00:26:46.760 --> 00:26:51.200
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: because the MSMEs comprise 99.5% of the business establishment

asr-000570
00:26:51.200 --> 00:26:53.399
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and 62% of the labor force.

asr-000571
00:26:53.399 --> 00:26:58.480
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So [unclear] itong mga negosyanteng ito,

asr-000572
00:26:58.480 --> 00:27:00.799
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: then that will give jobs also to our people

asr-000573
00:27:00.799 --> 00:27:03.599
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and will also contribute to the GDP.

asr-000574
00:27:05.640 --> 00:27:07.720
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: To prepare industries for the future,

asr-000575
00:27:07.720 --> 00:27:10.360
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: we recently launched our flagship AI and

asr-000576
00:27:10.360 --> 00:27:13.840
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: scale-up center in our head office, kasi

asr-000577
00:27:13.840 --> 00:27:18.220
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: um, we've also noticed that a lot of our MSMEs natatakot sa AI.

asr-000578
00:27:18.600 --> 00:27:22.559
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So, we want them to have at least a knowledge

asr-000579
00:27:22.559 --> 00:27:28.240
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: how they can use AI as a tool for them to help their businesses grow

asr-000580
00:27:28.240 --> 00:27:30.440
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and not something that they can be scared of.

asr-000581
00:27:30.440 --> 00:27:35.480
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So, we just launched this together with Converge and other private sector

asr-000582
00:27:35.480 --> 00:27:38.619
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: because we realized that government and private sector,

asr-000583
00:27:38.799 --> 00:27:42.159
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: together, mas marami tayong maa-achieve as

asr-000584
00:27:42.159 --> 00:27:44.460
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: as we continue to work with them.

asr-000585
00:27:47.159 --> 00:27:51.040
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: And then we also launched a very ambitious SSF in Butuan.

asr-000586
00:27:51.480 --> 00:27:54.799
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: But these are projects that must be done

asr-000587
00:27:54.799 --> 00:28:00.399
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: And once it finishes, marami po tayong matutulungan.

asr-000588
00:28:00.399 --> 00:28:03.360
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Kasi sometimes when we get shared services facilities,

asr-000589
00:28:03.360 --> 00:28:04.800
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: we only get one machine.

asr-000590
00:28:05.240 --> 00:28:06.640
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: And then hanggang doon lang.

asr-000591
00:28:06.640 --> 00:28:09.880
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: But sometimes we need to start the process

asr-000592
00:28:09.880 --> 00:28:11.519
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and we need to finish it.

asr-000593
00:28:11.519 --> 00:28:15.079
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So, we have a very big SSF in Butuan.

asr-000594
00:28:15.399 --> 00:28:18.000
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Actually, siya, printing and packaging center.

asr-000595
00:28:18.000 --> 00:28:22.420
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So, if I have a product, then I go to this facility

asr-000596
00:28:22.679 --> 00:28:24.279
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and then I can print it.

asr-000597
00:28:24.279 --> 00:28:27.279
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: I can also package it.

asr-000598
00:28:27.279 --> 00:28:30.200
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So pag tapos 'yung project, tapos

asr-000599
00:28:30.200 --> 00:28:30.880
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: 'yung product, and

asr-000600
00:28:30.880 --> 00:28:32.279
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and then the market access,

asr-000601
00:28:32.279 --> 00:28:35.060
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: they can just go to the different regional offices nationwide

asr-000602
00:28:35.480 --> 00:28:38.800
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: or 1,400 Negosyo Centers nationwide

asr-000603
00:28:39.120 --> 00:28:41.799
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: to find market access for these products.

asr-000604
00:28:41.799 --> 00:28:45.399
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So, we have this for them.

asr-000605
00:28:45.399 --> 00:28:47.400
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: And third is the consumer protection.

asr-000606
00:28:47.760 --> 00:28:51.760
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: The DTI continues to uphold consumer protection and fair trade,

asr-000607
00:28:51.760 --> 00:28:55.760
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: ensuring that our economic gains translate into real benefits

asr-000608
00:28:55.760 --> 00:28:56.880
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: for every Filipino.

asr-000609
00:28:57.440 --> 00:28:59.900
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Through rigorous nationwide enforcement,

asr-000610
00:28:59.960 --> 00:29:03.000
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: we inspected over 14,000 establishments

asr-000611
00:29:03.480 --> 00:29:06.120
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: while maintaining high compliance rate

asr-000612
00:29:06.120 --> 00:29:07.760
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: to further protect the public.

asr-000613
00:29:08.440 --> 00:29:09.960
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We closely monitored

asr-000614
00:29:09.960 --> 00:29:11.519
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: over 5,000 firms

asr-000615
00:29:11.519 --> 00:29:14.559
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: to secure the price and supply of basic necessities

asr-000616
00:29:14.559 --> 00:29:15.679
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and prime commodities.

asr-000617
00:29:18.200 --> 00:29:19.840
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: There are a lot of products now

asr-000618
00:29:19.840 --> 00:29:21.399
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: that come into the Philippines.

asr-000619
00:29:21.960 --> 00:29:23.960
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So, we need to protect the consumers

asr-000620
00:29:23.960 --> 00:29:26.279
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: from the products that are being sold in the market.

asr-000621
00:29:26.279 --> 00:29:28.740
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: A lot of them are compliant,

asr-000622
00:29:29.399 --> 00:29:32.320
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: but there are some that are also hazardous to us.

asr-000623
00:29:32.320 --> 00:29:34.440
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: 'Yung iba nakakasunog, 'yung iba

asr-000624
00:29:34.440 --> 00:29:37.279
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: nakaka... nakakasira na ng property.

asr-000625
00:29:37.279 --> 00:29:39.640
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So, we need to be strict on this.

asr-000626
00:29:39.640 --> 00:29:43.120
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So, we also need additional funding for this one.

asr-000627
00:29:45.399 --> 00:29:47.399
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Madam Chair and honorable members,

asr-000628
00:29:47.399 --> 00:29:50.559
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: the fiscal year 2027 budget proposal

asr-000629
00:29:50.559 --> 00:29:53.760
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: reflects our commitment to creating more jobs,

asr-000630
00:29:53.760 --> 00:29:55.540
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: attracting quality investments,

asr-000631
00:29:55.919 --> 00:29:57.279
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: expanding exports,

asr-000632
00:29:57.279 --> 00:29:59.240
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: strengthening Filipino enterprises,

asr-000633
00:29:59.240 --> 00:29:59.519
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and...

asr-000634
00:29:59.519 --> 00:30:00.559
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: enterprises, and protecting consumers.

asr-000635
00:30:01.240 --> 00:30:05.180
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: DTI programs is intended to generate economic opportunities

asr-000636
00:30:05.279 --> 00:30:08.180
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: that extend well beyond the department itself.

asr-000637
00:30:08.919 --> 00:30:10.760
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Entrepreneurs seeking growth,

asr-000638
00:30:10.760 --> 00:30:13.880
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: investors seeking stability and predictability,

asr-000639
00:30:14.480 --> 00:30:16.440
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: exporters seeking more markets,

asr-000640
00:30:16.440 --> 00:30:18.460
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and consumers seeking protection.

asr-000641
00:30:19.080 --> 00:30:21.180
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Governments build infrastructure,

asr-000642
00:30:21.519 --> 00:30:24.080
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: enact reforms, and open doors.

asr-000643
00:30:24.080 --> 00:30:26.760
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: But you can count on the Department of Trade and Industry

asr-000644
00:30:26.760 --> 00:30:30.980
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: to ensure these opportunities translate into thriving industries.

asr-000645
00:30:31.640 --> 00:30:34.120
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We stand fully committed to your progress,

asr-000646
00:30:34.120 --> 00:30:38.919
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and we will execute our mandate as best and as aggressive as we can

asr-000647
00:30:38.919 --> 00:30:43.279
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: to build a highly connected and consumer-oriented Philippine economy

asr-000648
00:30:43.279 --> 00:30:44.619
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: where no one is left behind.

asr-000649
00:30:45.320 --> 00:30:49.980
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Before I end, I would like to show a video of Tatak Pinoy.

asr-000650
00:30:51.480 --> 00:30:52.759
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: DTI is the chair.

asr-000651
00:30:53.279 --> 00:30:55.440
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We want the people to know that these are the products

asr-000653
00:30:55.440 --> 00:30:58.840
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: These are the products that are being made in the Philippines

asr-000654
00:30:58.840 --> 00:31:00.039
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and sold globally,

asr-000655
00:31:00.039 --> 00:31:03.039
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and these are products that we are very proud of.

asr-000656
00:31:03.039 --> 00:31:06.260
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So, again, can we show the Tatak Pinoy?

asr-000657
00:31:06.799 --> 00:31:08.639
