DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Thank you, Honorable Congressman.

asr-000707
00:35:48.960 --> 00:35:51.400
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: No, Pax Silica actually is just...

asr-000708
00:35:52.160 --> 00:35:54.440
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: It's actually one of the many ecozones

asr-000709
00:35:54.440 --> 00:35:56.380
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: that we have here in the Philippines

asr-000710
00:35:56.720 --> 00:35:59.280
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: or that we plan to build here in the Philippines.

asr-000711
00:35:59.280 --> 00:36:02.359
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We have here Undersecretary Perry Rodolfo,

asr-000712
00:36:02.359 --> 00:36:04.360
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: who can explain it in detail.

asr-000713
00:36:05.280 --> 00:36:06.680
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Usec. Perry, please.

asr-000714
00:36:06.680 --> 00:36:07.319
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Thank you, Chair.

asr-000715
00:36:07.319 --> 00:36:08.480
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Thank you, Secretary.

asr-000716
00:36:08.480 --> 00:36:12.440
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: And thank you for the question, Representative Cendaña.

asr-000717
00:36:12.440 --> 00:36:15.440
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: We fully welcome this opportunity to be able to provide

asr-000718
00:36:15.440 --> 00:36:17.819
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: more clarity on Pax Silica,

asr-000719
00:36:18.359 --> 00:36:22.280
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: particularly because, ang dami nga ho, kagaya ng sinabi ninyo, Representative Cendaña,

asr-000720
00:36:22.280 --> 00:36:25.960
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: ang dami ng mga lumalabas na balita.

asr-000721
00:36:25.960 --> 00:36:29.860
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: But first of all, talagang we welcome this opportunity

asr-000722
00:36:29.920 --> 00:36:31.440
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: and we welcome all of the comments,

asr-000723
00:36:31.440 --> 00:36:34.400
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: whether negative or positive, dahil ho

asr-000724
00:36:34.400 --> 00:36:36.419
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: it really highlights

asr-000725
00:36:36.880 --> 00:36:41.359
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: that this can be a transformative economic basis

asr-000726
00:36:41.359 --> 00:36:42.579
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: for economic policy.

asr-000727
00:36:43.119 --> 00:36:44.880
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: The more that it is being discussed,

asr-000728
00:36:44.880 --> 00:36:47.440
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: kami naman po sa gobyerno, very much open, as I said,

asr-000729
00:36:47.440 --> 00:36:49.960
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: negative or positive, because it can only

asr-000730
00:36:50.440 --> 00:36:53.280
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: make the policy direction better pagka ho

asr-000731
00:36:53.280 --> 00:36:54.179
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: tayo'y nag-uusap.

asr-000732
00:36:54.599 --> 00:36:56.519
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: So we really welcome this opportunity.

asr-000733
00:36:57.240 --> 00:37:00.520
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Banggitin ko lang ho na lahat ho ng mga dokumento

asr-000734
00:37:00.520 --> 00:37:03.800
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: that we have signed, that we have transmitted to the U.S.,

asr-000735
00:37:03.800 --> 00:37:07.839
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: that they have transmitted to us, iyon ho ang mga signed na documents natin

asr-000736
00:37:07.839 --> 00:37:11.460
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: ay nasa BOI website as early as April 25.

asr-000738
00:37:12.040 --> 00:37:17.959
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: So, pinost na ho natin iyan doon in the spirit of transparency din ho para makita na rin ho ng ating mga kababayan.

asr-000742
00:37:18.480 --> 00:37:31.599
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Meron din ho tayong mga short video clips about what Pax Silica is at ano po yung project doon sa New Clark City. Unfortunately lang ho, kaunti lang ang mga nanonood. As of this time, I think as of last week,

asr-000743
00:37:31.599 --> 00:37:37.920
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: nasa 790 views na tayo. But we hope that through this hearing, mas marami pa ho ang sumilip

asr-000744
00:37:37.920 --> 00:37:41.720
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: sana noong mga dokumento na iyon at saka yung mga video clips.

asr-000745
00:37:41.720 --> 00:37:43.720
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Excuse me, Usec. Where is the video again?

asr-000746
00:37:43.720 --> 00:37:45.200
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Saan po siya naka-post?

asr-000747
00:37:45.200 --> 00:37:57.919
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Nandito po sa BOI website, so boi.gov.ph/discussion-on-pax-silica-and-the-ai-native-industrial-hub.

asr-000748
00:37:59.520 --> 00:38:03.800
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: We can provide a copy, Honorable Chair.

asr-000749
00:38:03.800 --> 00:38:04.240
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Okay, Usec.

asr-000750
00:38:04.240 --> 00:38:10.640
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: And second ho, it's very important to distinguish between the partnership and the project.

asr-000751
00:38:10.640 --> 00:38:21.280
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Kasi nagkakalituhan talaga, pag pinag-usapan yung Pax Silica, akala nila iyon na yung ginagawa ho natin sa New Clark City, iyon na ho yung buong Pax Silica.

asr-000752
00:38:21.880 --> 00:38:25.340
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Pero we have to distinguish between the partnership and the project.

asr-000753
00:38:25.880 --> 00:38:38.119
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Pax Silica as a partnership is actually a non-binding statement or declaration that we have signed on to together with now 23 other countries and an economy.

asr-000754
00:38:39.400 --> 00:38:44.700
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: It is really for securing the supply chain for your AI tech ecosystem.

asr-000755
00:38:45.319 --> 00:38:57.000
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Kung halimbawa, ang sinasabi ho nila dito ay, if the past century was run on oil and on steel, this new century will be run on compute capacity.

asr-000756
00:38:57.480 --> 00:39:08.180
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: And it is about securing the entire supply chain from mining, minerals, to advanced manufacturing, to data centers.

asr-000757
00:39:08.520 --> 00:39:12.819
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: To the software that take advantage of this compute capacity.

asr-000758
00:39:13.240 --> 00:39:14.819
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: So the whole supply chain po yun.

asr-000759
00:39:15.960 --> 00:39:29.520
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ang pagdating ko dito sa atin pong project, yung New Clark City po is just one of the projects na pinupush ho ng Pilipinas at saka isang partner country doon sa Pax Silica.

asr-000760
00:39:29.920 --> 00:39:31.520
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: It is just one of the project.

asr-000761
00:39:31.520 --> 00:39:35.820
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: And this project will really be focused on advanced manufacturing.

asr-000762
00:39:36.359 --> 00:39:37.960
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: So contrary po sa mga...

asr-000763
00:39:37.960 --> 00:39:42.040
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Agam-agam sa mga concern, we fully understand the concerns.

asr-000764
00:39:42.040 --> 00:39:47.160
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: And lahat naman po ng mga sinasabi ng mga stakeholders natin, tama naman po.

asr-000765
00:39:47.160 --> 00:40:04.319
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Kaya lang po, yung assumption, halimbawa po tungkol sa kakain ng napakalaking power at tubig, yung mga AI data centers, tama naman po na kumakain talaga sila ng power and water.

asr-000766
00:40:04.319 --> 00:40:08.940
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ang mali lang po ay hindi po iyon yung gagawin sa New Clark City.

asr-000767
00:40:09.240 --> 00:40:12.640
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ang gagawin po sa New Clark City is really for advanced manufacturing.

asr-000768
00:40:13.200 --> 00:40:18.079
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: So this would be for the equipment that will go into the AI data centers.

asr-000769
00:40:18.079 --> 00:40:23.599
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: But the AI data centers themselves will not be in the New Clark City.

asr-000770
00:40:23.599 --> 00:40:31.520
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Be that as it may, kahit ganun po, alam din naman po natin na advanced manufacturing kumakain pa rin po ng power, kumakain pa rin po ng water.

asr-000771
00:40:31.520 --> 00:40:35.960
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Just like any other export and manufacturing zones do.

asr-000772
00:40:35.960 --> 00:40:37.800
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ang usapan naman po natin dito.

asr-000773
00:40:37.800 --> 00:40:43.119
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ang basic condition po doon sa mag-develop po ng New Clark City.

asr-000774
00:40:43.119 --> 00:40:47.020
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: And ito, hindi sa [unclear] ng gobyerno.

asr-000775
00:40:47.599 --> 00:40:55.839
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: That you have to build your own roads, bring your own power, and then secure and reuse your own water.

asr-000776
00:40:55.839 --> 00:41:00.720
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: So yun po ang usapan natin doon sa mag-develop doon sa New Clark City.

asr-000777
00:41:00.720 --> 00:41:02.839
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: And isang project lang po yun.

asr-000778
00:41:02.839 --> 00:41:05.740
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Meron po yung whole stack ng AI po.

asr-000779
00:41:06.359 --> 00:41:08.400
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Mag-uusap pa ho tayo ng ibang

asr-000780
00:41:09.079 --> 00:41:12.119
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Possible locations for those other areas.

asr-000781
00:41:12.119 --> 00:41:15.240
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Halimbawa po, pag pinag-usapan natin data center.

asr-000782
00:41:15.880 --> 00:41:21.040
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: It may happen in another location na mas appropriate for data center.

asr-000783
00:41:21.040 --> 00:41:24.960
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ibig sabihin, mas available yung tubig at mas available yung power.

asr-000784
00:41:24.960 --> 00:41:31.380
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: But again, build your own power, secure your own water, secure and reuse your own water, build your own roads.

asr-000785
00:41:31.800 --> 00:41:38.480
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Halimbawa po, just last week, kausap po natin isang locality, isang LGU dito sa Manila.

asr-000786
00:41:38.880 --> 00:41:43.839
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ang pinag-uusapan naman po natin is an IC Design National Hub.

asr-000787
00:41:43.839 --> 00:41:45.580
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: So this is more service-oriented.

asr-000788
00:41:46.000 --> 00:41:54.400
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Pero pinag-uusapan na natin yun sa isang LGU dito sa Manila na meron na po silang 13 IC Design companies,

asr-000789
00:41:54.400 --> 00:41:57.000
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: four of which are Filipino companies.

asr-000790
00:41:57.000 --> 00:42:05.080
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: At meron silang kolehyo doon na ginagastusan din ng LGU na nakafocus sa microelectronics.

asr-000791
00:42:05.359 --> 00:42:09.040
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Very important for the IC design industry.

asr-000792
00:42:09.040 --> 00:42:16.160
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: And ang kausap po natin na partner na tutulong dito sa IC Design Hub po natin ay hindi ang U.S.

asr-000793
00:42:16.160 --> 00:42:20.340
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: But another partner which is within the Pax Silica partnership.

asr-000794
00:42:20.839 --> 00:42:24.119
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: So iyon ho, iba ho yung partnership, iba yung mga project.

asr-000795
00:42:24.119 --> 00:42:29.900
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: New Clark City is just one of the projects and it will be focused on the advanced manufacturing.

asr-000796
00:42:30.240 --> 00:42:31.460
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Thank you, representative.

asr-000797
00:42:31.599 --> 00:42:33.680
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Thank you, Yusek.

asr-000798
00:42:33.680 --> 00:42:37.060
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Madam Chair, thank you, Yusek Rodolfo.

asr-000799
00:42:37.559 --> 00:42:42.200
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Medyo hindi po na-assuage yung fears ng ating mga kababayan sa inyo pong sagot.

asr-000800
00:42:42.200 --> 00:42:48.440
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: In fact, sa halip na ma-assuage yung fears, medyo mas naalarma tayo knowing na multiple sites pala ito.

asr-000801
00:42:48.440 --> 00:42:56.779
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Madam Chair, may we direct the DTI to kindly submit to the committee the prospective sites for the other projects under the Pax Silica agreement.

asr-000802
00:42:57.280 --> 00:43:02.020
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Lalong-lalo na po nakaka-bother yung usapin ng use of resources.

asr-000803
00:43:02.079 --> 00:43:06.520
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Medyo mahirap pong sabihin na bring your own water and electricity kasi alam naman po natin,

asr-000804
00:43:06.520 --> 00:43:08.040
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: pag tubig, doon po magta-tap.

asr-000805
00:43:08.040 --> 00:43:09.599
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sa atin pong water table iyan.

asr-000806
00:43:09.599 --> 00:43:12.000
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So, hindi po infinite ang ating tubig.

asr-000807
00:43:12.000 --> 00:43:15.160
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Finite po yan at kailangan po yan ng ating mga kababayan.

asr-000808
00:43:15.160 --> 00:43:19.500
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Let me now go to a discussion on the concerns of the communities.

asr-000809
00:43:20.680 --> 00:43:25.720
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Nakonsulta po ba ang mga community? Kasi napakahalaga po sa atin ang free prior and informed consent?

asr-000810
00:43:27.800 --> 00:43:27.940
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Usec.

asr-000811
00:43:29.920 --> 00:43:37.120
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: For the New Clark City project po, based doon sa binanggit na rin po publicly ni BCDA,

asr-000812
00:43:38.280 --> 00:43:41.559
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: ongoing po yung consultations.

asr-000813
00:43:41.559 --> 00:43:43.400
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So, ongoing ang consultations.

asr-000814
00:43:43.400 --> 00:43:47.920
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ibig sabihin, before entering into the agreement, hindi po nagkaroon ng consultation.

asr-000815
00:43:47.920 --> 00:43:48.539
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Tama po ba?

asr-000816
00:43:50.760 --> 00:43:51.520
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Madam Chair.

asr-000817
00:43:51.520 --> 00:43:52.839
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Usec., please. Thank you.

asr-000818
00:43:52.839 --> 00:44:00.980
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: On the specific project po sa Clark, the New Clark City is an existing master-planned industrial zone.

asr-000819
00:44:01.160 --> 00:44:05.040
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Tapos ho, on the specific na within that industrial zone,

asr-000820
00:44:05.040 --> 00:44:08.380
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: yung ating tinatawag na 1,620

asr-000821
00:44:08.640 --> 00:44:09.180
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: hectares,

asr-000822
00:44:09.599 --> 00:44:11.079
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: yun po yung kinukonsulta

asr-000823
00:44:11.079 --> 00:44:13.240
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: na project. Kasi bagong-bago

asr-000824
00:44:13.240 --> 00:44:14.900
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: lang din ho ito.

asr-000825
00:44:15.160 --> 00:44:17.000
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Kung mapapansin ninyo nga po,

asr-000826
00:44:17.000 --> 00:44:19.000
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: pinirmahan lang natin yung project

asr-000827
00:44:19.000 --> 00:44:20.419
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: na to. And it's a work in progress,

asr-000828
00:44:20.960 --> 00:44:23.000
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: by the way, on that new Clark City.

asr-000829
00:44:23.720 --> 00:44:24.960
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ongoing pa rin po yung

asr-000830
00:44:24.960 --> 00:44:26.559
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: discussions doon.

asr-000831
00:44:26.559 --> 00:44:28.800
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Madam Chair, may we direct the DTI

asr-000832
00:44:28.800 --> 00:44:30.100
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: through this committee to submit

asr-000833
00:44:31.040 --> 00:44:32.880
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: the status of the ongoing

asr-000834
00:44:32.880 --> 00:44:34.680
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: consultations being conducted with the

asr-000835
00:44:34.680 --> 00:44:36.880
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: communities. Lubha po tayong naaalarma

asr-000836
00:44:36.880 --> 00:44:39.159
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: dito sa nababalitang mga pagpapalayas

asr-000837
00:44:39.480 --> 00:44:40.839
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: sa mga katutubo sa kanila

asr-000838
00:44:40.839 --> 00:44:42.559
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: pong lupang ninuno. Kaya nga po

asr-000839
00:44:42.559 --> 00:44:44.740
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: nag-file tayo ng House Resolution 1227

asr-000840
00:44:45.079 --> 00:44:46.599
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: para po imbestigahan at silipin

asr-000841
00:44:47.520 --> 00:44:48.880
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: kung ano ang nangyayari talaga

asr-000842
00:44:48.880 --> 00:44:50.720
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: on the ground when it comes to the implementation

asr-000843
00:44:50.720 --> 00:44:52.599
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: of this project. Let me move on

asr-000844
00:44:52.599 --> 00:44:54.920
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: to another topic, Madam Chair,

asr-000845
00:44:54.920 --> 00:44:56.640
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: and this is on the issue of the

asr-000846
00:44:56.640 --> 00:44:58.359
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: DEFA, which was also mentioned

asr-000847
00:44:58.359 --> 00:44:59.400
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: by the

asr-000849
00:44:59.400 --> 00:45:04.440
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: good Secretary. Nagsimula na po ang negosasyon, pipirmahan na po ito pagdating ng Nobyembre.

asr-000850
00:45:04.920 --> 00:45:10.480
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ang tanong po ng mga concerned sectors, particularly po mga kasamahan natin mula sa SENTRO, isang labor center,

asr-000851
00:45:10.480 --> 00:45:16.800
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: would the DTI commit to making the negotiated texts available to Congress and the public before the agreement is signed

asr-000852
00:45:16.800 --> 00:45:20.140
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: so that the implications can be properly reviewed and scrutinized?

asr-000853
00:45:22.280 --> 00:45:23.419
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Who may answer po?

asr-000854
00:45:24.359 --> 00:45:28.520
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Yes, Honorable Congressman. Yes, Madam Chair. Yes,

asr-000855
00:45:28.520 --> 00:45:37.680
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We will make it available for everyone, and ibibigay din namin sa kanila what are the advantages of this DEFA

asr-000856
00:45:37.680 --> 00:45:44.079
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and what the businesses or the industries can gain from this DEFA.

asr-000857
00:45:44.079 --> 00:45:50.640
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Kasi actually, this is very important kasi we're now in the digital space, digital economy na po tayo.

asr-000858
00:45:50.640 --> 00:45:57.560
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So we need to be able to adapt to the changes of the times and napakaimportante ng

asr-000859
00:45:58.880 --> 00:46:00.780
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: the digital space nowadays.

asr-000860
00:46:00.960 --> 00:46:03.079
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: And then kasali rin dito yung AI.

asr-000861
00:46:03.079 --> 00:46:09.960
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So we will give a complete and a comprehensive information on this DEFA.

asr-000862
00:46:09.960 --> 00:46:11.340
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Definitely. Sure po iyon.

asr-000863
00:46:12.000 --> 00:46:14.320
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Maraming salamat, Madam Secretary.

asr-000864
00:46:14.800 --> 00:46:20.619
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Hihintayin po namin yung details of the agreement at sana po ma-submit before tayo magplenaryo.

asr-000865
00:46:21.240 --> 00:46:23.920
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Let me move on to the RACE program.

asr-000866
00:46:23.920 --> 00:46:29.759
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Idinulog po ito ng mga kasama natin mula sa Philippine Metalworkers Alliance, or PMA.

asr-000867
00:46:30.119 --> 00:46:38.399
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kasi po doon sa budget ng 2026, ang na-veto na item ay para sana sa restoring the RACE program ng DTI.

asr-000868
00:46:38.880 --> 00:46:42.760
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ang tanong po natin ay ano po ang mangyayari dito sa RACE program?

asr-000869
00:46:42.760 --> 00:46:44.920
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ito po ba'y itutuloy pang pondohan ng gobyerno?

asr-000870
00:46:48.319 --> 00:46:59.280
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Madam Chair and Honorable Congressman, yes, matutuloy itong RACE program because marami pa ring combustion vehicles that are being produced here in the Philippines.

asr-000872
00:46:59.280 --> 00:47:05.920
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So we're just finishing some of the final touches of this program.

asr-000873
00:47:05.920 --> 00:47:07.599
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: But definitely, matutuloy ito.

asr-000874
00:47:07.599 --> 00:47:11.079
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We're just getting the budget also from the DBM for this.

asr-000875
00:47:11.079 --> 00:47:21.440
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So once completed po ito, we will again inform the public, just like when we had the EVs and all other programs po ng DTI.

asr-000876
00:47:21.440 --> 00:47:23.859
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Ini-inform po namin talaga yung public para alam nila.

asr-000877
00:47:24.760 --> 00:47:27.640
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Madam Chair, may we request DTI to submit to this committee?

asr-000878
00:47:27.640 --> 00:47:31.240
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: the details of their proposed budget for the RACE program.

asr-000879
00:47:31.240 --> 00:47:35.640
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Under the Electric Vehicle Industry Development Act, or EVIDA,

asr-000880
00:47:36.280 --> 00:47:38.600
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: under the DOE po itong programa,

asr-000881
00:47:39.319 --> 00:47:43.160
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: at may sarili din pong electric vehicle program, EVIS naman,

asr-000882
00:47:43.160 --> 00:47:45.319
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: I understand ang DTI. Posible

asr-000883
00:47:45.319 --> 00:47:50.280
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: po kaya na isa na lang yung EVIS at RACE or any other program sa automotive sector

asr-000884
00:47:50.280 --> 00:47:52.880
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ay sa isang ahensya na lang po ng gobyerno ilagay

asr-000885
00:47:52.880 --> 00:47:58.260
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: para hindi po silo. Sayang po yung resources lalo na kung may duplication ng trabaho?

asr-000885-caption-01
00:48:00.040 --> 00:48:26.719
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We will be coordinating closely. But for the EVs, kasi this is the incentive scheme for those companies that want to manufacture electric vehicles in the country, whether hybrid plus electric or pure electric po. So again, we will give you the complete information on this for both RACE and for EVs also. Thank you, Honorable Congressman.

asr-000886
00:48:27.240 --> 00:48:28.839
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Thank you, Madam Secretary. Madam Chair,

asr-000887
00:48:28.839 --> 00:48:32.000
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: may we ask the DTI kung meron po ba tayong industrial policy

asr-000888
00:48:32.000 --> 00:48:36.679
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: which will serve as a roadmap para sa electric vehicle or automotive sector in particular?

asr-000889
00:48:47.319 --> 00:48:48.839
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Can you repeat again the question?

asr-000890
00:48:48.839 --> 00:48:54.160
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ang tanong po ay meron po ba tayong industrial policy that could serve as a roadmap

asr-000891
00:48:54.160 --> 00:48:57.660
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: para po sa electric vehicle or automotive sector sa ating bansa?

asr-000892
00:48:59.839 --> 00:49:01.280
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Okay, you may answer.

asr-000893
00:49:01.960 --> 00:49:04.640
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Madam Chair, on the automotive industry po,

asr-000894
00:49:04.640 --> 00:49:08.940
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: our policy really is to shift towards the electric vehicle

asr-000895
00:49:09.280 --> 00:49:14.580
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: as the main technology type for the sector po.

asr-000896
00:49:15.280 --> 00:49:17.640
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Except that hindi ho natin pwedeng pabayaan din,

asr-000897
00:49:17.640 --> 00:49:21.599
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: kagaya ng nasabi ninyo yung mga nasa metalworking sector ho natin.

asr-000898
00:49:21.599 --> 00:49:27.040
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: That's why meron tayong transition towards the full electric vehicle adoption.

asr-000899
00:49:27.040 --> 00:49:32.040
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Nabanggit na rin ho naman ni Presidente doon sa SONA niya yung adoption ng electric vehicle.

asr-000900
00:49:32.040 --> 00:49:32.920
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Thank you.

asr-000901
00:49:32.920 --> 00:49:33.520
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Madam Chair,

asr-000903
00:49:33.520 --> 00:49:36.000
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: may we request the DTI to submit to this committee

asr-000904
00:49:36.000 --> 00:49:39.040
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: the said policy which will serve as a roadmap for the industry?

asr-000905
00:49:39.799 --> 00:49:42.160
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Yes, Honorable Congressman, we will.

asr-000906
00:49:42.160 --> 00:49:45.839
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Actually, from the CARS program, we shifted lang to the RACE program

asr-000907
00:49:45.839 --> 00:49:52.880
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: to encourage more companies that want to build manufacturing for the combustion vehicles.

asr-000908
00:49:52.880 --> 00:49:56.799
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: That's why yung CARS program naging RACE program po ito.

asr-000909
00:49:56.799 --> 00:49:59.720
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: And then to adapt to the changing times also,

asr-000910
00:49:59.720 --> 00:50:05.640
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: which is the electric vehicles now, both hybrid plus electric or total electric.

asr-000912
00:50:05.640 --> 00:50:07.440
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Meron ding incentive scheme.

asr-000913
00:50:07.440 --> 00:50:08.440
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: This is also, again,

asr-000914
00:50:08.440 --> 00:50:11.800
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: to encourage more companies to invest in the Philippines.

asr-000915
00:50:12.440 --> 00:50:14.720
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Thank you, Madam Chair, Madam Secretary.

asr-000916
00:50:15.319 --> 00:50:20.980
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Punta na po ako dito sa usapin na mainit na mainit ngayon. Ito pong usapin ng union busting sa DHL.

asr-000917
00:50:21.640 --> 00:50:26.740
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: We know that DHL is a major partner of the DTI for MSME support and development.

asr-000918
00:50:27.359 --> 00:50:31.559
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: DHL Philippines is also a partner of the DTI Supply Chain and Logistics Center

asr-000919
00:50:31.559 --> 00:50:33.319
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: and was part of the private sector group.

asr-000920
00:50:33.319 --> 00:50:39.600
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: convened by the SCLC for the centralization of logistics expertise and industry collaboration.

asr-000921
00:50:42.839 --> 00:50:48.520
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Nababahala po tayo kasi ang DHL po ngayon ay may kaso ng union busting.

asr-000922
00:50:48.520 --> 00:50:54.100
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So ang tanong po ng lahat, how can DHL claim to be a socially responsible corporation

asr-000923
00:50:54.280 --> 00:50:58.600
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: when it is openly violating the rights of workers in their Sukat warehouse?

asr-000924
00:50:58.920 --> 00:51:03.359
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: How can the Philippines tout DHL as a principled partner for inclusive,

asr-000925
00:51:03.359 --> 00:51:04.580
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: and social development?

asr-000926
00:51:05.160 --> 00:51:10.319
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: How can a union buster genuinely claim that it works for the interests of ordinary people,

asr-000927
00:51:10.319 --> 00:51:13.400
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: those that the MSMEs cater to and represent?

asr-000928
00:51:13.799 --> 00:51:18.160
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: In line with this, we would like to call the attention of the DTI Secretary on this matter

asr-000929
00:51:18.160 --> 00:51:22.799
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: and urgently review its partnership with DHL Philippines in light of the current

asr-000930
00:51:22.799 --> 00:51:25.559
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: problems faced by its workers. Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-000932
00:51:25.559 --> 00:51:26.640
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Thank you, Cong. Perci.

asr-000933
00:51:26.640 --> 00:51:27.880
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: That will be your last question.

asr-000934
00:51:27.880 --> 00:51:28.520
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Very valid.

asr-000935
00:51:28.520 --> 00:51:29.880
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Who may answer po?

asr-000936
00:51:29.880 --> 00:51:32.440
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Thank you, Madam Chair and Honorable Congressman.

asr-000939
00:51:32.440 --> 00:51:42.020
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Actually, the Supply Chain and Logistics Department in DTI is just to actually share with our

asr-000940
00:51:42.559 --> 00:51:48.799
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: businesses how they can use the logistics companies to move their products.

asr-000941
00:51:48.799 --> 00:51:50.520
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Let's say, exporters ako.

asr-000942
00:51:50.520 --> 00:51:56.920
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So I now can engage or can meet with all of these logistics companies to explore the different

asr-000943
00:51:56.920 --> 00:52:02.680
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: costs that they can incur or that they will incur.

asr-000944
00:52:02.680 --> 00:52:07.920
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: When they move their products, kasi gusto natin ma-move yung mga products at the least possible

asr-000945
00:52:07.920 --> 00:52:10.280
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: time and the least cost.

asr-000946
00:52:10.280 --> 00:52:15.359
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So iyon po ang engagement ng DTI with DHL.

asr-000947
00:52:15.359 --> 00:52:20.000
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: But with your concerns po, we can work with the DOLE on this.

asr-000948
00:52:20.000 --> 00:52:25.400
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Ang importante na is to move the products, especially during calamity when we need to

asr-000949
00:52:25.400 --> 00:52:31.280
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: move the food products to the different regions, especially that we are 7,600 islands,

asr-000950
00:52:31.280 --> 00:52:33.000
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and for the exporters

asr-000951
00:52:33.000 --> 00:52:34.720
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: to engage

asr-000952
00:52:34.720 --> 00:52:37.040
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: with all of these logistics companies so

asr-000953
00:52:37.040 --> 00:52:38.280
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: they can see kung anong

asr-000954
00:52:38.280 --> 00:52:39.359
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: mas beneficial

asr-000955
00:52:39.359 --> 00:52:40.200
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: para sa kanila.

asr-000956
00:52:40.200 --> 00:52:42.000
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Yun po ang role

asr-000957
00:52:42.000 --> 00:52:49.720
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: ng Supply Chain and Logistics Department namin sa DTI and the role of the logistics company once it comes

asr-000958
00:52:49.720 --> 00:52:52.760
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: to the DTI. Doon po, to

asr-000959
00:52:52.760 --> 00:52:58.880
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: encourage businesses po, to encourage rin, and to really make sure that the movements of the goods are

asr-000960
00:52:58.880 --> 00:53:02.079
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: fast, cheap, and para ma-exhaust

asr-000961
00:53:02.079 --> 00:53:03.640
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: natin yung full potential

asr-000962
00:53:03.640 --> 00:53:10.880
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: ng mga logistics companies na ito in terms of movements of the products po.

asr-000963
00:53:10.880 --> 00:53:12.799
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Thank you, Madam Secretary. Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-000964
00:53:12.799 --> 00:53:19.200
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Paalala lamang po, i-review po natin yung agreements natin with this union buster, that is DHL. Marami pong salamat.

asr-000965
00:53:19.200 --> 00:53:24.119
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Thank you, Cong. Perci. And again, may we remind the DTI to submit the documents requested

asr-000966
00:53:24.119 --> 00:53:27.600
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: so that the concerns of Representative Cendaña will be addressed.

asr-000967
00:53:27.880 --> 00:53:36.510
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Next in line to ask from the majority is Representative Ando Oaminal.

asr-000968
00:53:36.520 --> 00:53:48.559
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Thank you, Madam Chair. Good morning, Secretary, and to the members of the DTI family, and to our distinguished Chair.

asr-000969
00:53:49.559 --> 00:53:59.060
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Madam Chair, this representation received some reports on alleged irregularities

asr-000970
00:53:59.319 --> 00:54:10.680
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: and alleged unlawful practices being observed by the department, particularly in the procurement division.

asr-000971
00:54:10.680 --> 00:54:18.700
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: And so I wrote a letter to the good secretary as part of this representation's oversight functions.

asr-000972
00:54:19.079 --> 00:54:27.059
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: And when I received and reviewed the documents forwarded to my office,

asr-000973
00:54:27.440 --> 00:54:28.520
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: it seems that...

asr-000974
00:54:28.520 --> 00:54:30.940
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: some of the claims are valid.

asr-000975
00:54:31.640 --> 00:54:38.939
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: So in particular, I wrote about the procurement of several vehicles.

asr-000976
00:54:39.400 --> 00:54:51.540
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: And I have several documents here, but I would like to focus first on the procurement with bidding number 24.057.

asr-000977
00:54:53.200 --> 00:54:56.960
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: May staffa sa copy kung sino po yung sasagot.

asr-000978
00:54:56.960 --> 00:54:59.999
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Yung BAC chairperson po ay si...

asr-000979
00:55:01.720 --> 00:55:09.680
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Mr. Christian Ablan, and the HoPE is a certain attorney, Asec. Uvero.

asr-000980
00:55:10.359 --> 00:55:15.960
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: However, sa NTP, iba po yung nag-sign, hindi po yung HoPE.

asr-000981
00:55:15.960 --> 00:55:19.839
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Sa contract agreement, iba po din yung nag-sign.

asr-000982
00:55:19.839 --> 00:55:21.420
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Si... ang BAC chairman ang nag-sign.

asr-000983
00:55:22.760 --> 00:55:34.400
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: So, may we know under what authorities, bakit nagkakaiba-iba po yung HoPE for each transaction?

asr-000984
00:55:34.400 --> 00:55:42.220
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Honorable Chair, I'll defer to Chris Ablan so he can respond to your queries and issues.

asr-000985
00:55:44.480 --> 00:55:46.880
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: Madam Chair, thank you very much.

asr-000986
00:55:47.640 --> 00:55:49.319
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: Mr. Chair, that is correct.

asr-000987
00:55:49.319 --> 00:55:53.280
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: I am currently the BAC chair of the DTI Bids and Awards Committee.

asr-000988
00:55:54.480 --> 00:55:58.239
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: We will look into the PR of this.

asr-000989
00:55:59.319 --> 00:56:06.319
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: But as a matter of practice, and following the rules, the BAC chair does not sign a notice to proceed.

asr-000990
00:56:06.319 --> 00:56:09.039
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: It's the HoPE.

asr-000991
00:56:10.680 --> 00:56:27.159
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: And in the case of then-HoPE Asec. Uvero, there may have been a transfer since Asec. Uvero transferred to the Bureau of Customs.

asr-000992
00:56:27.920 --> 00:56:30.220
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: We had a new HoPE.

asr-000993
00:56:30.839 --> 00:56:39.740
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: And so, we will look into this PR and submit to the committee clarifications on what was mentioned by the good congressman.

asr-000994
00:56:41.119 --> 00:56:46.840
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Usec, andiyan naman po, finorward sa inyo yung copy ng documents that came from your office.

asr-000995
00:56:47.400 --> 00:56:49.839
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: So, can you please check the contract agreement?

asr-000996
00:56:49.839 --> 00:56:52.780
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Isn't it your signature on that document?

asr-000997
00:56:59.079 --> 00:57:01.920
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: Mr. Chair, for PR number...

asr-000998
00:57:02.520 --> 00:57:11.160
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: For this particular PR, the Bids and Awards Committee head was not yet this person, Mr. Chair.

asr-000999
00:57:11.160 --> 00:57:13.699
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: It was still Usec Boy Vismonte.

asr-001000
00:57:15.079 --> 00:57:15.859
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: You were the one...

asr-001001
00:57:17.160 --> 00:57:23.160
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: But you were the one who signed the BAC resolution for this transaction.

asr-001002
00:57:23.160 --> 00:57:26.400
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: You signed the BAC resolution and you signed the contract agreement.

asr-001003
00:57:26.400 --> 00:57:29.440
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: You signed the BAC resolution as the BAC chairperson, Mr. Chair.

asr-001004
00:57:30.480 --> 00:57:31.079
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: Mr. Chair,

asr-001005
00:57:31.079 --> 00:57:34.359
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: The document given to me by your staff is dated 2023.

asr-001006
00:57:34.359 --> 00:57:37.160
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: I wasn't yet with the DTI.

asr-001007
00:57:37.160 --> 00:57:38.359
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: So, we'll just check.

asr-001008
00:57:38.359 --> 00:57:38.799
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: No, no, no.

asr-001009
00:57:38.799 --> 00:57:42.279
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Nandiyan po yung document, Mr. Chair.

asr-001010
00:57:50.480 --> 00:57:51.280
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: Yes, Mr. Chair.

asr-001011
00:57:51.280 --> 00:57:52.320
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: For this particular...

asr-001012
00:57:53.240 --> 00:58:07.400
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: I just confirmed for BAC Resolution 280, series of 2024, procurement of vehicles from Toyota Pasong Tamo.

asr-001013
00:58:07.400 --> 00:58:09.920
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: I signed as the chair of the Bids and Awards Committee.

asr-001014
00:58:09.920 --> 00:58:11.280
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: That is correct, Mr. Chair.

asr-001015
00:58:13.880 --> 00:58:15.079
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: What document are you talking about?

asr-001016
00:58:15.079 --> 00:58:17.859
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: You're talking about the BAC resolution, Mr. Chair, right?

asr-001017
00:58:18.240 --> 00:58:19.200
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: Yes, Mr. Chair.

asr-001018
00:58:19.200 --> 00:58:24.579
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: I'm talking about BAC Resolution 280, series of 2024.

asr-001019
00:58:25.119 --> 00:58:27.720
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: I signed as the chair of the BAC.

asr-001020
00:58:27.720 --> 00:58:33.700
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: And then approved by our head of procuring entity, then Asec. Uvero.

asr-001021
00:58:34.160 --> 00:58:43.160
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: And, Mr. Chair, did you also sign the contract agreement for that particular transaction?

asr-001022
00:58:56.400 --> 00:58:57.599
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: Yes, Mr. Chair.

asr-001023
00:58:57.599 --> 00:58:59.220
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: I am signed here.

asr-001042
00:58:59.559 --> 00:59:08.919
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: So, Mr. Chair, matanong ko lang po, bakit hindi po si HoPE ang nag-sign, and bakit po yung BAC chairperson ang nag-sign ng contract agreement?

asr-001043
00:59:10.319 --> 00:59:11.640
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: We'll look into this, Mr. Chair.

asr-001044
00:59:11.640 --> 00:59:19.839
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: I think this was the time when there was a transition between Asec. Uvero and the new HoPE.

asr-001045
00:59:19.839 --> 00:59:28.839
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Mr. Chair, Section 11.2.5 of the 2016 Revised IRR of RA 9184 provides

asr-001046
00:59:28.839 --> 00:59:34.480
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: that in no case shall the HoPE and/or the approving authority be the chairperson

asr-001047
00:59:34.480 --> 00:59:35.459
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: or a member of the BAC.

asr-001048
00:59:36.240 --> 00:59:40.000
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Do you agree with this, Mr. Chair?

asr-001049
00:59:42.839 --> 00:59:43.680
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: Yes, Mr. Chair.

asr-001050
00:59:43.680 --> 00:59:44.740
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: The congressman is correct.

asr-001051
00:59:45.400 --> 00:59:53.119
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: We'll look into this February 5, 2025 contract agreement and align it with our records of

asr-001052
00:59:53.119 --> 00:59:55.359
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: who was the head of procuring entity.

asr-001053
00:59:55.359 --> 00:59:56.680
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: We'll clarify the committee, Mr. Chair.

asr-001054
00:59:56.680 --> 00:59:57.200
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: So, Mr. Chair.

asr-001055
00:59:57.200 --> 01:00:08.700
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: So, Mr. Chair, do you confirm that in this particular transaction, you violated Section 11.2.5 of RA 9184?

asr-001056
01:00:08.880 --> 01:00:14.800
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: Mr. Chair, I don't recall signing this particular document, but the signature shows my signature.

asr-001057
01:00:15.200 --> 01:00:17.220
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: So I'll verify with my records, Mr. Chair.

asr-001058
01:00:17.559 --> 01:00:21.119
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: What are you trying to imply, Mr. Chair, that you don't recall signing that document?

asr-001059
01:00:21.119 --> 01:00:24.420
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: That document came from the, no less than the Office of the Secretary.

asr-001060
01:00:25.960 --> 01:00:32.319
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Are you denying now that that document is a certified copy of the original?

asr-001061
01:00:33.799 --> 01:00:37.440
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: Mr. Chair, I would have to check my records.

asr-001062
01:00:37.440 --> 01:00:43.219
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: I do have photocopies of all the contracts and resolutions I signed, Mr. Chair.

asr-001063
01:00:44.000 --> 01:00:44.359
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Okay.

asr-001064
01:00:44.359 --> 01:00:50.639
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Mr. Chair, granting that this is a real document, kasi galing po sa inyo,

asr-001065
01:00:51.839 --> 01:00:56.000
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: do you consider this a violation of Section

asr-001066
01:00:56.000 --> 01:01:01.139
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: 11.2.5 of the 2016 Revised IRR of RA 9184,

asr-001067
01:01:01.640 --> 01:01:03.519
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: granting that this is a real document?

asr-001068
01:01:04.039 --> 01:01:07.260
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Kasi you are now questioning the validity of the document, Mr. Chair.

asr-001069
01:01:12.720 --> 01:01:16.920
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: I have to check with my records, Mr. Chair, as to this document.

asr-001070
01:01:16.920 --> 01:01:22.420
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Mr. Chair, my question is, granting that this is a real document.

asr-001071
01:01:33.680 --> 01:01:39.119
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Cong. Oaminal, while the Asec. is checking his documents, do you have other questions

asr-001072
01:01:39.119 --> 01:01:40.880
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: regarding the budget proposal?

asr-001073
01:01:40.880 --> 01:01:41.920
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Yes, Mr. Chair.

asr-001074
01:01:41.920 --> 01:01:48.960
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: I have other documents here, different procurement documents that have the same issues

asr-001075
01:01:48.960 --> 01:01:52.960
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: involving different officers of the agency.

asr-001076
01:01:52.960 --> 01:01:58.640
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Yung sa akin lang po kasi, of course, you are presenting your budget proposal

asr-001077
01:01:58.640 --> 01:02:01.160
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: and humihingi po kayo ng budget.

asr-001078
01:02:01.160 --> 01:02:09.240
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: It is our responsibility also to ensure that in the disbursement,

asr-001079
01:02:09.240 --> 01:02:18.060
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: the funds that have been approved for the agency, regular and lawful po yung pag-disburse.

asr-001080
01:02:18.720 --> 01:02:22.979
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Eto ngayon, may nakikita po tayo na alleged irregularities.

asr-001081
01:02:23.680 --> 01:02:36.760
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: So, how can we be assured, Mr. Chair, na hindi po ganito yung paggastos nila ng pera, Mr. Chair?

asr-001083
01:02:36.760 --> 01:02:37.820
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: And my

asr-001084
01:02:38.240 --> 01:02:40.240
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: question is very simple.

asr-001085
01:02:41.400 --> 01:02:49.359
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: If this is a real document, which, kung peke ito, eh di you forwarded fake documents to my office.

asr-001086
01:02:51.000 --> 01:02:55.200
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: All right, Cong. Oaminal, kanina kasi yung timer na-stuck.

asr-001087
01:02:55.200 --> 01:02:57.480
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: I think that would be the last question.

asr-001088
01:02:57.480 --> 01:03:01.200
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: But I want you to raise this concern.

asr-001089
01:03:01.200 --> 01:03:07.139
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: If you can do a sidebar after this, kasi I think this is a very valid concern, Cong. Oaminal.

asr-001090
01:03:08.119 --> 01:03:10.200
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: But at the very least, can we hear, Mr. Chair,

asr-001091
01:03:10.200 --> 01:03:16.540
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: the response of the agency if they affirm and confirm that there is indeed a violation

asr-001092
01:03:17.000 --> 01:03:19.319
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: of our procurement law, Mr. Chair?

asr-001093
01:03:19.319 --> 01:03:19.559
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Okay.

asr-001094
01:03:19.559 --> 01:03:24.300
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: For the record, last response for our representative.

asr-001095
01:03:24.319 --> 01:03:24.640
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Thank you.

asr-001096
01:03:24.640 --> 01:03:25.420
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-001097
01:03:28.000 --> 01:03:33.880
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: I signed as the head of our admin service.

asr-001098
01:03:34.359 --> 01:03:39.520
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: So, we will have to check whether the hat I was wearing in signing this contract agreement

asr-001099
01:03:39.520 --> 01:03:42.040
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: is as the head of our HR and admin service.

asr-001100
01:03:43.760 --> 01:03:49.520
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: By our rules, I am authorized to sign some contracts, particularly contracts of lease.

asr-001101
01:03:49.520 --> 01:03:53.760
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: So, we have to get back to the good congressman if whether I signed the contract agreement

asr-001102
01:03:53.760 --> 01:03:57.880
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: as being the head of our admin service or being the HoPE.

asr-001103
01:03:57.880 --> 01:04:00.720
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: If you look at the contract agreement, it does not say that I am the HoPE.

asr-001104
01:04:00.720 --> 01:04:04.200
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: It does say that I am assistant secretary for our management services group.

asr-001105
01:04:04.200 --> 01:04:07.520
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: So, we will clarify this matter, Madam Chair, with the good congressman.

asr-001106
01:04:07.920 --> 01:04:08.960
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: Uh, but I assure you that there's

asr-001107
01:04:09.240 --> 01:04:10.000
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: no irregularities.

asr-001108
01:04:10.799 --> 01:04:15.400
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: I do sign contracts on a different hat.

asr-001109
01:04:15.400 --> 01:04:20.279
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: In this particular case, I do think I was signing it as the head of our admin service,

asr-001110
01:04:20.279 --> 01:04:20.920
DTI BAC Chair Christian Ablan: Mr. Chair.

asr-001111
01:04:20.920 --> 01:04:21.680
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Thank you, Asec.

asr-001112
01:04:21.680 --> 01:04:24.200
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Thank you po.

asr-001113
01:04:24.200 --> 01:04:27.160
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: I will be interpellating again sa second round.

asr-001114
01:04:27.160 --> 01:04:32.240
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: So, baka po pagdating sa second round, meron nang sagot and ma-clarify na

asr-001115
01:04:32.240 --> 01:04:34.839
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: that the documents are indeed not fake.

asr-001116
01:04:34.839 --> 01:04:35.960
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Maraming salamat po, Madam Chair.

asr-001117
01:04:35.960 --> 01:04:37.120
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Exactly. Thank you so much.

asr-001118
01:04:37.640 --> 01:04:39.880
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Next on the, um,

asr-001119
01:04:39.880 --> 01:04:43.559
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: list would be from the minority Representative Iris Montes.

asr-001120
01:04:43.559 --> 01:04:44.000
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Thank you.

asr-001121
01:04:45.599 --> 01:04:47.200
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-001122
01:04:47.200 --> 01:04:48.660
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Magandang umaga po sa lahat.

asr-001123
01:04:51.000 --> 01:04:54.760
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: The Philippines continues to run on a trade deficit.

asr-001124
01:04:54.760 --> 01:05:01.080
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Ano po, ah, ano po ang specific allocations natin in the 2027 budget of the DTI

asr-001125
01:05:01.680 --> 01:05:06.480
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: that directly addresses or nakatuon po sa pag-reduce ng ating trade deficit?

asr-001126
01:05:06.960 --> 01:05:09.719
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: While I understand sa presentation po ninyo,

asr-001127
01:05:10.559 --> 01:05:17.319
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: ni-report ninyo na nag-grow yung exports, pero pag ibinangga pa rin po natin, may trade deficit pa rin po tayo.

asr-001128
01:05:17.319 --> 01:05:26.080
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Halimbawa po, ano ang puwede nating magawa para sa 2027 budget po ninyo na mapalakas natin yung export diversification natin,

asr-001129
01:05:26.640 --> 01:05:29.760
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: yung mga import substitution or industry modernization?

asr-001130
01:05:30.160 --> 01:05:31.240
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Thank you po.

asr-001131
01:05:31.240 --> 01:05:34.719
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Ah, thank you, Madam Chair and Honorable Congresswoman.

asr-001132
01:05:35.160 --> 01:05:38.440
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We can really strengthen dito sa exports, no, kasi

asr-001133
01:05:38.440 --> 01:05:45.200
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: we've seen, um, nung 2025, all-time high, tapos from January to June, pataas din po.

asr-001134
01:05:45.200 --> 01:05:51.000
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So, this is where we see that there's really potential in really actually pushing the Philippine product.

asr-001135
01:05:51.000 --> 01:05:52.039
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So, that's one.

asr-001136
01:05:52.039 --> 01:05:58.000
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Number two is providing market access also for local products to be sold within the country

asr-001137
01:05:58.000 --> 01:06:04.480
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: kasi malaki rin po ang potential ng local product, and the market is so big in the Philippines.

asr-001138
01:06:04.480 --> 01:06:08.720
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Actually, that is what attracts also the foreign investors in our country.

asr-001139
01:06:08.720 --> 01:06:20.380
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So doon po naka-concentrate now, um, naka-concentrate ang DTI, and also our foreign trade attachés in the 21 countries globally.

asr-001140
01:06:20.760 --> 01:06:26.400
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: They hold the opportunities and possibilities, but we still need, of course, to join more

asr-001141
01:06:26.400 --> 01:06:30.020
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: trade shows kasi kailangan natin i-showcase din yung ating mga produkto.

asr-001142
01:06:30.559 --> 01:06:36.599
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: There are some trade shows that we've actually joined na actually nagbaka-sakali.

asr-001143
01:06:38.000 --> 01:06:39.359
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Very ambitious sila,

asr-001144
01:06:39.359 --> 01:06:42.760
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: but we've seen a lot of growth here.

asr-001146
01:06:42.760 --> 01:06:44.400
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Like, let's just example lang,

asr-001147
01:06:44.400 --> 01:06:46.400
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: we joined the Hong Kong Cosmoprof.

asr-001148
01:06:46.400 --> 01:06:55.200
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Yung kalaban natin actually is very strong, which is the Chinese products, the Korean

asr-001149
01:06:55.200 --> 01:06:57.460
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: products, and so many other products.

asr-001150
01:06:57.720 --> 01:06:58.440
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: What we did was

asr-001151
01:06:58.440 --> 01:07:06.400
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: a strategic focus on our coconut products, or coconut-based products.

asr-001152
01:07:06.400 --> 01:07:08.440
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Doon tayo nag-concentrate.

asr-001153
01:07:08.440 --> 01:07:13.400
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So we had an investment of 8 million, and we generated 150 million.

asr-001154
01:07:13.799 --> 01:07:20.880
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So it goes to show, kung magiging strategic lang tayo sa ating pagsali rin sa mga different

asr-001155
01:07:20.880 --> 01:07:27.039
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: trade shows, and to join more trade shows globally, we can really increase our exports

asr-001156
01:07:27.039 --> 01:07:27.599
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: even more.

asr-001157
01:07:29.440 --> 01:07:37.560
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: With the free trade agreement, which I've also mentioned earlier, the 23 that the Marcos administration

asr-001158
01:07:39.160 --> 01:07:40.419
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: is concluding,

asr-001159
01:07:40.480 --> 01:07:42.160
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: yung iba, we have five more to go,

asr-001160
01:07:42.160 --> 01:07:43.839
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: so magiging 23 siya.

asr-001161
01:07:43.839 --> 01:07:50.359
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: That will really open a lot of the big markets to our products, kasi ang nangyayari, we have

asr-001162
01:07:50.359 --> 01:07:55.160
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: the products, but when we export it, medyo mataas because of the tariff.

asr-001163
01:07:55.160 --> 01:07:59.440
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: But now that we have preferential tariffs, that will also give us more opportunities

asr-001164
01:07:59.440 --> 01:08:00.279
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: to sell.

asr-001165
01:08:00.279 --> 01:08:02.679
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So doon tayo naka-rely sa exports.

asr-001166
01:08:03.079 --> 01:08:06.799
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Then expansion of investors in the Philippines.

asr-001167
01:08:06.799 --> 01:08:08.119
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So we keep on.

asr-001168
01:08:08.119 --> 01:08:11.020
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Upgrading also our incentive schemes.

asr-001169
01:08:11.440 --> 01:08:14.319
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: In fact, we have the SIPP 2026, no?

asr-001170
01:08:14.319 --> 01:08:19.279
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So we have up to 99 years na yung ownership – or lease ng land, I mean.

asr-001171
01:08:19.279 --> 01:08:23.999
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So we keep on upgrading based on the needs of the investors that come in.

asr-001172
01:08:24.960 --> 01:08:30.540
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: I've been going to the presidential visits, and a lot of the companies that have already

asr-001173
01:08:30.960 --> 01:08:33.000
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: businesses here continue to expand.

asr-001174
01:08:33.000 --> 01:08:36.640
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So doon tayo nakafocus din.

asr-001175
01:08:36.640 --> 01:08:38.960
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: And of course, there's a Middle East crisis.

asr-001176
01:08:38.960 --> 01:08:40.679
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So medyo naano ng konti,

asr-001177
01:08:40.679 --> 01:08:42.600
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: but yung exports natin

asr-001178
01:08:42.600 --> 01:08:43.400
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: tuloy-tuloy ang

asr-001179
01:08:43.400 --> 01:08:44.960
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: pag-increase pa rin.

asr-001180
01:08:44.960 --> 01:08:46.719
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: And the strength of the local market,

asr-001181
01:08:46.719 --> 01:08:48.279
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: the products that are being sold

asr-001182
01:08:48.279 --> 01:08:50.460
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: also locally have also increased

asr-001183
01:08:51.679 --> 01:08:52.960
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: compared to last year.

asr-001184
01:08:52.960 --> 01:08:55.120
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So naka-monitor po kami doon

asr-001185
01:08:55.120 --> 01:08:58.819
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: sa talagang, ano, increase doon.

asr-001186
01:08:59.400 --> 01:09:00.740
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Doon kami naka-monitor.

asr-001187
01:09:00.759 --> 01:09:01.599
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Then for export,

asr-001188
01:09:02.120 --> 01:09:04.279
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: we are joining more trade shows.

asr-001189
