asr-001239
01:12:06.880 --> 01:12:10.120
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: For SB Corporation, aggressive po kami sa pag-promote.

asr-001240
01:12:10.520 --> 01:12:18.160
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: And then what we did now was, in the past, SB Corporation was a financial institution that just has one big loan.

asr-001241
01:12:18.639 --> 01:12:21.320
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So some people, they cannot relate

asr-001242
01:12:21.320 --> 01:12:23.040
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: to one big loan.

asr-001243
01:12:23.040 --> 01:12:30.500
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Mas, um, mas naging madali para sa kanila or mas naging, um, specific.

asr-001244
01:12:31.679 --> 01:12:35.199
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: It's easier for us to loan out the money kung specific because then they can relate.

asr-001245
01:12:35.199 --> 01:12:36.239
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Ay, para sa akin to.

asr-001246
01:12:36.239 --> 01:12:38.000
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Ay, may loan pala para sa akin.

asr-001247
01:12:38.000 --> 01:12:39.380
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Ay, pwede pala ako dito.

asr-001248
01:12:39.840 --> 01:12:44.099
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So naging aggressive po kami in promoting this loans program.

asr-001249
01:12:44.639 --> 01:12:50.660
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Especially, naging, um, attractive din po ito because, um, up to 5 million, no collateral.

asr-001250
01:12:50.960 --> 01:12:55.280
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: And then one year rin po, no payment of principal and interest.

asr-001251
01:12:55.280 --> 01:13:00.520
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So this is for 3-year loan, 5-years loan.

asr-001252
01:13:00.520 --> 01:13:02.360
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So ang dami na po nag-avail, no.

asr-001253
