asr-002061
01:44:32.719 --> 01:44:38.080
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Also help them, help their businesses or help the industry.

asr-002062
01:44:39.080 --> 01:44:46.280
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: And also maging advantage sa kanila yung digital economic framework agreement na ito.

asr-002063
