DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: They also don't know how to do the requirements abroad.

asr-002066
01:44:59.880 --> 01:45:04.779
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: But through the consolidators that have already existing markets globally,

asr-002067
