DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: madali na lang sila makapasok.

asr-002068
01:45:06.960 --> 01:45:11.120
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So we are using consolidators to promote also the products.

asr-002069
01:45:11.760 --> 01:45:18.080
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: And then also the food industry where we see a lot of strength also in our exports.

asr-002070
01:45:18.080 --> 01:45:27.120
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Not just exports is one, but there's also a huge local market which we need to also address.

asr-002071
01:45:27.800 --> 01:45:30.520
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: And then also wearables.

asr-002072
01:45:30.520 --> 01:45:35.159
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So those are the, at least for this week, ito yung mga kinakausap namin.

asr-002073
01:45:35.159 --> 01:45:39.719
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So we keep a close working relationship actually with a lot of industries.

asr-002074
01:45:39.719 --> 01:45:43.480
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So more or less, alam namin kung ano yung mga kailangan nila.

asr-002075
01:45:43.480 --> 01:45:46.960
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We try to help them as best as we can.

asr-002076
