asr-002164
01:51:00.119 --> 01:51:03.639
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Isa sa mga pangunahing concerns ng ating mga consumers ay

asr-002165
01:51:03.639 --> 01:51:05.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang pagsilit ng presyo ng mga bilihin

asr-002166
01:51:06.239 --> 01:51:08.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at bilang chair ng Price Coordinating Council,

asr-002167
01:51:08.880 --> 01:51:11.719
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: maaari ba nating malaman kung ano ang mga hakbang

asr-002168
01:51:11.719 --> 01:51:13.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na ginawa ng DTI para

asr-002169
01:51:13.800 --> 01:51:16.719
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ma-stabilize ang prices ng basic necessities

asr-002170
01:51:16.719 --> 01:51:18.639
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at prime commodities,

asr-002171
01:51:18.639 --> 01:51:21.399
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: lalong-lalo na sa panahon ng sunod-sunod na kalamidad?

asr-002172
01:51:22.760 --> 01:51:26.680
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Thank you, Honorable Congresswoman and Honorable Chair.

asr-002173
01:51:28.040 --> 01:51:30.800
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Last year, we did not have any price increase

asr-002174
01:51:30.800 --> 01:51:33.079
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: for basic necessities and prime commodities,

asr-002175
01:51:33.079 --> 01:51:34.900
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: the list that's controlled by the DTI.

asr-002176
01:51:35.320 --> 01:51:38.860
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We keep a very close relationship and coordination

asr-002177
01:51:38.960 --> 01:51:41.699
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: with the manufacturers and also the retailers.

asr-002178
01:51:44.800 --> 01:51:49.079
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We do our best to really make sure na hindi gumagalaw yung prices.

asr-002179
01:51:49.079 --> 01:51:53.560
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: In fact, in spite of the Middle East crisis,

asr-002180
01:51:53.560 --> 01:51:54.980
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: from January

asr-002181
01:51:55.280 --> 01:51:57.199
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: or from last year until May,

asr-002182
01:51:57.199 --> 01:51:59.239
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: we did not have any price increase

asr-002183
01:51:59.239 --> 01:52:01.639
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: for the basic necessities and prime commodities,

asr-002184
01:52:01.639 --> 01:52:05.000
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: dahil maganda yung relationship ng DTI

asr-002185
01:52:05.000 --> 01:52:08.000
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: at saka yung mga manufacturers whose products

asr-002186
01:52:08.000 --> 01:52:11.320
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: are part of the basic necessities and prime commodities.

asr-002187
01:52:11.320 --> 01:52:15.600
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So again, we continue to work closely with them.

asr-002188
01:52:16.360 --> 01:52:20.639
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We keep a win-win relationship with them.

asr-002189
01:52:20.639 --> 01:52:23.920
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So kung may mga needs sila sa ibang mga departments

asr-002190
01:52:23.920 --> 01:52:26.020
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: to keep their operations going,

asr-002191
01:52:27.320 --> 01:52:30.360
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: to keep them also kaipapano,

asr-002192
01:52:30.360 --> 01:52:32.759
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: to find other markets for them globally,

asr-002193
01:52:33.560 --> 01:52:39.960
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: we do that for them para at least mabigay din nila sa taong bayan

asr-002194
01:52:40.360 --> 01:52:43.960
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: yung mababang presyo ng or yung stable na prices

asr-002195
01:52:43.960 --> 01:52:46.179
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: ng basic necessities and prime commodities.

asr-002196
01:52:46.920 --> 01:52:49.320
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Nagmamonitor din kami nationwide.

asr-002197
01:52:49.639 --> 01:52:51.920
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We have 18 regional offices

asr-002198
01:52:51.920 --> 01:52:53.880
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and we do this on a daily basis.

asr-002199
01:52:53.880 --> 01:52:58.599
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: May departamento talaga in each of the regional offices for this.

asr-002200
01:52:58.599 --> 01:53:04.119
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So we only monitor the supermarkets and the groceries.

asr-002201
01:53:04.119 --> 01:53:08.620
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So we have not experienced any...

asr-002202
01:53:10.199 --> 01:53:13.800
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Yung mga hindi sumusunod, halos lahat sila sumusunod.

asr-002203
01:53:13.800 --> 01:53:16.880
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: And if hindi sila sumusunod, sinasabihan namin sila.

asr-002204
01:53:16.880 --> 01:53:20.080
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: But in general,

asr-002205
01:53:20.599 --> 01:53:22.679
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: or in majority,

asr-002206
01:53:22.679 --> 01:53:27.219
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: they really follow the rules of the DTI.

asr-002207
01:53:28.400 --> 01:53:29.400
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Yes, Madam Chair.

asr-002208
01:53:29.400 --> 01:53:32.319
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang reports sa atin ay halos lahat sumusunod.

asr-002209
01:53:32.800 --> 01:53:34.299
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yung mga hindi sumusunod,

asr-002210
01:53:35.320 --> 01:53:36.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: anong naging parusa sa kanila?

asr-002211
01:53:36.920 --> 01:53:40.080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Meron ba tayong mga napanagot sa mga hindi sumusunod?

asr-002212
01:53:41.800 --> 01:53:46.679
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Actually, we have action or we enforce.

asr-002213
01:53:47.000 --> 01:53:48.760
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We monitor and we enforce

asr-002214
01:53:48.760 --> 01:53:51.059
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: for those that don't follow.

asr-002215
01:53:51.239 --> 01:53:55.939
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: I'll forward you, ma'am, to Gino

asr-002216
01:53:57.679 --> 01:54:01.840
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: to report what we do with those that don't follow.

asr-002217
01:54:01.840 --> 01:54:02.880
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Yes, Madam Chair.

asr-002218
01:54:02.880 --> 01:54:07.599
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Gusto po natin malaman yung extent ng price monitoring activities.

asr-002219
01:54:07.599 --> 01:54:12.119
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nabanggit na ang sakop lang yung mga retailers, grocery supermarkets natin.

asr-002220
01:54:12.119 --> 01:54:16.719
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pero tama ko ba hindi dito kasama yung mga public markets?

asr-002221
01:54:16.719 --> 01:54:17.880
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: For the public markets,

asr-002222
01:54:17.880 --> 01:54:19.480
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: we defer to the DA.

asr-002223
01:54:19.480 --> 01:54:25.459
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So the DA is the one in charge of the wet market.

asr-002224
01:54:25.760 --> 01:54:27.599
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Ang DTI, ang kinokontrol niya,

asr-002225
01:54:27.599 --> 01:54:29.719
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: are the supermarkets and the groceries

asr-002226
01:54:29.960 --> 01:54:32.339
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: for the basic necessities and prime commodities.

asr-002227
01:54:32.800 --> 01:54:33.840
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Yes, Madam Chair.

asr-002228
01:54:34.520 --> 01:54:36.280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: May we hear from Asek Malyari

asr-002229
01:54:36.280 --> 01:54:38.820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: on the report on the price monitoring?

asr-002230
01:54:39.440 --> 01:54:40.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Asek, please. Thank you.

asr-002231
01:54:42.639 --> 01:54:43.899
DTI price-monitoring and product-standards official: Good afternoon, Madam Chair.

asr-002232
01:54:47.280 --> 01:54:47.760
DTI price-monitoring and product-standards official: Um...

asr-002233
01:54:47.760 --> 01:54:49.820
DTI price-monitoring and product-standards official: As reported by our dear Secretary,

asr-002234
01:54:50.079 --> 01:54:53.239
DTI price-monitoring and product-standards official: we have very good compliance po na sa retail networks natin

asr-002235
01:54:53.239 --> 01:54:54.719
DTI price-monitoring and product-standards official: ng supermarkets and groceries.

asr-002236
01:54:54.719 --> 01:54:57.760
DTI price-monitoring and product-standards official: And these are the ones prioritized by our price monitors,

asr-002237
01:54:57.760 --> 01:55:01.239
DTI price-monitoring and product-standards official: yung mga malalapit po at malalaki na chains.

asr-002238
01:55:01.239 --> 01:55:04.999
DTI price-monitoring and product-standards official: Because, again, with our relationship with them,

asr-002239
01:55:06.199 --> 01:55:07.860
DTI price-monitoring and product-standards official: single pricing sila usually

asr-002240
01:55:09.199 --> 01:55:12.560
DTI price-monitoring and product-standards official: based po dun sa suggested retail price bulletin natin.

asr-002241
01:55:12.560 --> 01:55:16.339
DTI price-monitoring and product-standards official: So nasusunod po siya automatically throughout the retail network, no?

asr-002242
01:55:17.280 --> 01:55:22.119
DTI price-monitoring and product-standards official: And if and when meron tayong nakikita na slightly above

asr-002243
01:55:22.119 --> 01:55:23.560
DTI price-monitoring and product-standards official: the suggested retail prices,

asr-002244
01:55:23.560 --> 01:55:25.979
DTI price-monitoring and product-standards official: we issue them letter of inquiry muna.

asr-002245
01:55:26.840 --> 01:55:29.239
DTI price-monitoring and product-standards official: Letter of inquiry and then the establishment

asr-002246
01:55:29.239 --> 01:55:33.199
DTI price-monitoring and product-standards official: nakakapagpaliwanag po sila kung bakit slightly mataas

asr-002247
01:55:33.199 --> 01:55:35.800
DTI price-monitoring and product-standards official: yung kanilang presyuhan sa ating SRP.

asr-002248
